21	+// Dependency handling is install-time only. Dispatch stays zero-cost: a
22	+// plugin invokes its deps as entire-<dep> via PATH at runtime (the managed
23	+// bin dir is prepended for plugin children), and `entire plugin doctor`
24	+// reports drift after the fact. There is deliberately no version-range
25	+// solver — requirements carry at most a minimum version.
