128	+	//    entire-hijack on PATH with no prompt (index installs never prompt).
129	+	//  - --force escalated across plugins: the already-installed check below
130	+	//    tests the *remote-declared* name, so reinstalling A let A's repo
131	+	//    declare name: B and replace an unrelated installed B.
132	+	//  - A dependency installed under a different name never satisfied the
133	+	//    requirement, so dependencySatisfied/doctor reported it missing forever
134	+	//    and every future parent install re-attempted it.
